  "historyNote": "#1547, eff 3-13-80; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; EXPIRED: 7-19-96 New. #6316, eff 8-13-96; amd by #6944, eff 2-24-99; ss by #7460, eff 3-15-01; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04, EXPIRED: 8-13-12 New. #10585, INTERIM, eff 5-13-14, EXPIRED: 11-10-14 New. #10875, eff 7-8-15; ss by #14332, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
